 - **I. Player Phase:** 1) draw up to 5 Action cards; 2) pass First Player token left (not on turn 1); 3) rounds of 2 Actions (or 1 Action + pass, or pass) clockwise until all players pass — after passing you sit out normal rounds for the rest of the Phase (Interruption remains permitted).
 - **II. Event Phase:** 4) advance Time (and Self-Destruct if active); 5) Intruders in Combat attack; 6) Intruders in Fire take 1 Injury; 7) resolve 1 Event card (Intruder movement, then event effect); 8) Intruder bag development.
+
+### Card and marker handling
+
+Draw to 5 at the start of the Player Phase; when a required Action draw finds the deck empty, shuffle that Character's Action discard into a new deck. Pass the First Player token left after drawing, except on turn 1. **Normal card discards are face up:** Action/Contamination → own Action discard; Items → matching Item discard; Event, Intruder Attack and Serious Wound → their respective discard piles. **Discarded markers → matching supply pools.** Follow explicit exceptions such as Search/Storage's face-down bottom-deck return and cards removed from the game.
 
